{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22382","headline":"寄元九 · 白居易","name":"寄元九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一病经四年，亲朋书信断。\n穷通合易交，自笑知何晚。\n元君在荆楚，去日唯云远。\n彼独是何人，心如石不转。\n忧我贫病身，书来唯劝勉。\n上言少愁苦，下道加餐饭。\n怜君爲谪吏，穷薄家贫褊。\n三寄衣食资，数盈二十万。\n岂是贪衣食，感君心缱绻。\n念我口中食，分君身上暖。\n不因身病久，不因命多蹇。\n平生亲友心，岂得知深浅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}